        "description": "修改环境变量。环境变量引用位置为api的后端服务地址时,修改对应环境变量会将使用该变量的所有api重新发布。",
        "schemes": [
          "https"
        ],
        "tags": [
          "专享版-环境变量管理"
        ],
        "x-api-type": "open-api",
        "x-api-framework": "RestfulAPI",
        "x-api-user": "IAM普通租户",
        "x-api-position": "管理面",
        "x-open-region-cloud": "hws,hws_hk,cmcc,ctc,dt,g42,hk_g42,hk_sbc,hk_tm,hws_eu,hws_ocb,ocb,sbc,tm,srg,ax",
        "operationId": "UpdateEnvironmentVariableV2",
